<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-089" chapter-id="c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren" source-id="s-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren-ws2835777">
  <p id="c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">今定洛陽而殺<persName id="c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0006" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_A">沈勁</persName>，實有愧于四海。」朝廷聞而嘉之，贈東陽太守。子<persName id="c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0031" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_AA">赤黔</persName>為大長秋。<persName id="c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0038" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_AA">赤黔</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-089-shen-chuqian-shuren:p001:m0041" ref="4c2_19b_bf4_AAA">叔任</persName>，義熙中為益州刺史。</p>
</text>
